        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon against a unit (excluding VEHICLE or TITANIC units), an unmodified wound roll of a 2+ is always successful.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
